{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分地方对人物心理作了额外解释或改变了原有因果，尤其S13把“明白谁也没法答应永远”改成“就算听到了”，削弱了人物心理的准确性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点加亮让人扫屏时能迅速抓住每段人物心理的核心，感受文字又按音乐进程出现，不必一开始同时处理所有信息，听觉和视觉也更容易对上。它的感受描写更细密，能捕捉情绪起伏中的细微变化；但Y的完整叙述在交代人物为什么这样想、为什么这样做，以及串联前后心理变化方面更自然、更准确。总体而言，我更愿意看X，因为它更能兼顾边听音乐边阅读的实际体验，但需要控制部分感受文字的过度阐释。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "88e95ab8-5413-46f9-ae9f-99698d58d1ef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T000616577556Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:07:09.381219+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "696806e84ab0ddc6ae199412a7df41c2fe0c8f2103a9188b424716e30267b812", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "to